{"sha": "71009fe101c90e8b35ad2bc18273ab8ab64c825871741bfae985fd446015b059", "body": ["\\begin{example}[\\texorpdfstring{\\qty{0.010}{mol/L}}{0.010 mol/L} 浓度下的乙酸]\\label{ex:g12:ka-and-pka:acetic}", "% ledger: pka:ethanoic", "$pK_a = 4.76$，故 $K_a = 10^{-4.76} = \\num{1.74e-5}$。于是", "$x^2 + \\num{1.74e-5}\\,x - \\num{1.74e-7} = 0$ 解得", "$x = \\qty{4.1e-4}{mol/L}$，pH 为 3.39。仅有 $\\num{4.1e-4}/0.010 =", "\\qty{4.1}{\\percent}$ 的酸已与水反应；同浓度的盐酸", "pH 为 2.0，已完全反应。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\fill[omThm!45] (0,1.3) rectangle (8,2.0);", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.1,1.65) {盐酸 \\ce{HCl}，\\qty{0.010}{mol/L}};", "  \\node[white, font=\\small\\bfseries] at (4,1.65) {\\ce{H3O+} + \\ce{Cl-}：\\qty{100}{\\percent}};", "  \\fill[omDef!35] (0,0) rectangle (7.67,0.7);", "  \\fill[omThm!45] (7.67,0) rectangle (8,0.7);", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.1,0.35) {乙酸 \\ce{CH3COOH}，\\qty{0.010}{mol/L}};", "  \\node at (3.8,0.35) {\\ce{CH3COOH} 保持原样：\\qty{95.9}{\\percent}};", "  \\draw[<-, omThm] (7.85,0.75) -- (8.4,1.1) node[right, font=\\footnotesize] {\\qty{4.1}{\\percent} 电离};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 同浓度的强酸与弱酸各会怎样：", "强酸全部转化为离子，弱酸则几乎不电离。", "由此得到两者的 pH 差，即 2.0 与 3.4。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{safety}{\\ghs[0.75cm]{GHS02}\\ghs[0.75cm]{GHS05}\\ghs[0.75cm]{GHS06}\\ghs[0.75cm]{GHS07}}", "% ledger: ghs:formic-acid", "浓甲酸易燃，会严重灼伤皮肤", "和眼睛，其蒸气有毒。仅由教师", "在通风橱内操作；练习中的稀溶液仍需", "佩戴护目镜。", "\\end{safety}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:1}", "写出下列物质的共轭碱：\\ce{HCOOH}、\\ce{NH4+}、\\ce{H2O}、\\ce{HCO3-}；", "并写出下列物质的共轭酸：\\ce{NH3}、\\ce{OH-}、\\ce{H2O}、\\ce{HCO3-}。", "哪些粒子是两性物质？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:2}", "求下列浓度盐酸的 pH：\\qty{0.10}{mol/L}、", "\\qty{0.0010}{mol/L} 和 \\qty{5.0e-3}{mol/L}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:3}", "某溶液的 pH 为 4.5，求 $[\\ce{H3O+}]$。另一溶液的 pH 为 11.2：", "求 \\qty{25}{\\celsius} 时的 $[\\ce{H3O+}]$ 和 $[\\ce{OH-}]$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:4}", "写出甲酸与水反应的方程式及 $K_a$ 的表达式，", "并对铵根离子作同样处理。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:5}", "哪一种酸较强：甲酸（$pK_a = 3.74$）还是乙酸", "（$pK_a = 4.76$）？哪一种碱较强：\\ce{HCOO-} 还是", "\\ce{CH3COO-}？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:6}", "某弱酸 HA 的溶液浓度为 \\qty{0.050}{mol/L}，pH 为 3.0。求", "$[\\ce{A-}]$、$[\\ce{HA}]$，再求 $K_a$ 与 $pK_a$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:7}", "求 \\qty{0.020}{mol/L} 苯甲酸（$pK_a = 4.20$）的 pH。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:8}", "求 \\qty{2.0e-3}{mol/L} 氢氧化钠溶液的 pH。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:9}", "利用 $pK_a$ 标度，将图中所示共轭对的酸", "按由强到弱排列。像 \\ce{HCl} 这样的强酸", "应位于何处？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:10}", "溶于水的二氧化碳使水略显酸性（共轭对", "\\ce{CO2,H2O}/\\ce{HCO3-}，$pK_a = 6.37$）。一份与空气接触的雨水样品", "测得 pH 为 5.6。求 $[\\ce{H3O+}]$，并与纯水比较。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:11}", "证明对共轭对 \\ce{NH4+}/\\ce{NH3}，有 $pK_a = pK_e - pK_b$，其中", "$K_b = \\num{1.8e-5}$ 是 \\ce{NH3 + H2O <=> NH4+ + OH-} 的平衡常数。", "求 $pK_a$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:12}", "乙酸的浓度为 \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}，pH 为 3.39。求", "稀释十倍后的 pH。它是否如强酸那样上升一个单位？", "请说明理由。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:13}", "碳酸氢根离子是两性物质。写出它与水的两个反应，", "并利用 $pK_a$ 标度写出其平衡常数。哪一个更大？", "由此可推测碳酸氢钠溶液的", "pH 应如何？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:ka-and-pka:14}", "将 \\qty{1.0e-3}{mol/L} 的盐酸稀释一千倍，", "再稀释一千倍。若草率套用规则，先得 pH 6，再得", "pH 9。为何稀释后的酸不可能达到 pH 9？极稀溶液的", "pH 趋近于何值？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}